The '''Horseman's Candle''' is an {{Epic}} item used to summon the [[Headless Horseman]] boss.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Horseman's Candle''' can be bought from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} during the [[Spooky Festival]] for {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=32}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = epic
|special_effect = Used to summon the Headless Horseman. This item can only be used at night!
}}
Only {{Green|1x}} [[Spooky Fragment]] can be obtained for damage ranking ({{Gold|1st}}, {{Silver|2nd}} or {{Bronze|3rd}}). However, placing the candle guarantees {{Item|Spooky Fragment|amount=4}}s.

The [[Headless Horseman]] can only be spawned at night in the:
* {{Zone|Graveyard}}
* {{Zone|Wilderness}}

On the {{Gamemode|Stranded}} gamemode, it can be spawned on the player's {{zone|Private Island}}.

It will announce who summoned it and where in the chat.

== Trivia ==
* The '''Horseman's Candle''' gives an average profit of {{BZC|1 Green Candy|1 Purple Candy|5 Spooky Fragment|-1 Horseman's Candle}} for the summoner, or {{BZC|3 Green Candy|3 Purple Candy|7 Spooky Fragment|-1 Horseman's Candle}} for a group of three.
** It therefore costs {{BZC|100 Horseman's Candle|-100 Green Candy|-100 Purple Candy|-500 Spooky Fragment}} to complete the [[Bestiary]] alone, or {{BZC|100 Horseman's Candle|-300 Green Candy|-300 Purple Candy|-700 Spooky Fragment}} as a group.

